      "location": "actual_read_design.capabilities and RuntimeEffectReceipt relationship/root generation guidance",
      "problem": "The general plan wording says root source_generation equals the selected revision/fence for all six versioned policies. RuntimeEffectReceipt uses SH-004/CustomerProfile as its root, so the effect is a child. Its revision token is its actual fence, while the grant source generation must track the actual Customer root when selected; these values need not be equal. The proposed pending-effect/profile fence0 example masks this distinction.",
